(function(){window.PhysicaRankPyqNeet_physics_workenergyandpower=[{id:"neet-2026-q025",pn:25,y:"NEET 2026 \xB7 21 Jun \xB7 Re-exam",tp:"Work, Energy and Power",st:"Work done by variable friction",q:"A particle of mass M moves along a horizontal x axis from x = 0 to x = L. The coefficient of kinetic friction varies as a function of x as \u03BC\u2096(x) = \u03BC\u2080 \u2212 \u03B1x, where \u03BC\u2080, \u03B1 are constants of appropriate dimensions, so that \u03BC\u2096(L) = 0. The total work done by the frictional force during the motion is n\u03BC\u2080MgL, where g is the acceleration due to gravity. The value of n is:",o:["1","1/3","1/2","3"],c:2,s:`Given \u03BC\u2096(x) = \u03BC\u2080 \u2212 \u03B1x and \u03BC\u2096(L) = 0 = \u03BC\u2080 \u2212 \u03B1L, so \u03BC\u2080 = \u03B1L.
Magnitude of work by friction: W_f = \u222BdW_f.
dW_f = f\u2096dx = \u03BC\u2096N dx = \u03BC\u2096Mg dx = (\u03BC\u2080 \u2212 \u03B1x)Mg dx.
W_f = \u222B\u2080\u1D38 \u03BC\u2080Mg dx \u2212 \u222B\u2080\u1D38 \u03B1Mg x dx = \u03BC\u2080Mg[x]\u2080\u1D38 \u2212 \u03B1Mg[x\xB2/2]\u2080\u1D38.
n\u03BC\u2080MgL = \u03BC\u2080MgL \u2212 (\u03BC\u2080/L)Mg(L\xB2/2) = \u03BC\u2080MgL/2.
So n = 1/2.`},{id:"neet-2026-q033",pn:33,y:"NEET 2026 \xB7 21 Jun \xB7 Re-exam",tp:"Work, Energy and Power",st:"Elastic collision and energy conservation",q:"Bob B of mass m at rest is hanging vertically from the ceiling via a massless string of length 10 m, as shown in the figure. Point mass A of mass m travelling horizontally with speed 10 ms\u207B\xB9 hits bob B elastically. The bob B rises h meter after the collision. Taking the acceleration due to gravity g = 10 ms\u207B\xB2 and neglecting the size of the bob, the value of h is:",o:["7","5","2.5","8"],c:1,s:`To reach the horizontal position, the bob would need a speed of 10\u221A2 m/s.
In an elastic collision of equal masses, the velocities are interchanged.
So the bob moves with 10 m/s after the collision.
By conservation of energy: mgh = (1)/(2)mv\xB2.
h = v\xB2/(2g).
h = (10)\xB2/(2 \xD7 10).
h = 5 m.`,fig:{w:300,h:200,alt:"A bob B hangs from a ceiling on a vertical string; point mass A at the same level on the left moves right at 10 ms\u207B\xB9 toward B.",d:[["l",150,15,190,15,"B"],["l",170,15,170,150],["c",170,150,3,"F"],["t",178,148,"B","s"],["c",110,150,3,"F"],["t",106,144,"A","es"],["l",115,150,145,150,"a"],["t",128,172,"10 ms\u207B\xB9","ms"]]}}]})();
